-preview\"\n          description: api version\n      responses:\n        \"200\":\n          description: OK\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: \"#/components/schemas/vectorStoreFileObject\"\n    delete:\n      operationId: Delete_Vector_Store_File\n      tags:\n        - AI Agents\n          - Vector Stores\n      summary: Delete a vector store file. This will remove the file from the vector store but the file itself will not be deleted. To delete the file, use the [delete file](/docs/api-reference/files/delete) endpoint.\n      parameters:\n        - name: project-name\n          in: path\n          description: The name of the project.\n          required: true\n          schema:\n            type: string\n        - in: path\n          name: vector_store_id\n          required: true\n          schema:\n            type: string\n          description: The ID of the vector store that the file belongs to.\n        - in: path\n          name: file_id\n          required: true\n          schema:\n            type: string\n          description: The ID of the file to delete.\n        - in: query\n          name: api-version\n          required: true\n          schema:\n            type: string\n            default: \"2025-05-15-preview\"\n          description: api version\n      responses:\n        \"200\":\n          description: OK\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: \"#/components/schemas/deleteVectorStoreFileResponse\"\n    # post:\n    #   operationId: updateVectorStoreFileAttributes\n    #   tags:\n    #     - AI Agents\n    #       - Vector Stores\n    #   summary: Update attributes on a vector store file.\n    #   parameters:\n    #     - in: path\n    #       name: vector_store_id\n    #       required: true\n    #       schema:\n    #         type: string\n    #         example: vs_abc123\n    #       description: The ID of the vector s